    <crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>The modified form of dentin derived from animal teeth. The most common example is from the tusks of mature elephants; similar material is obtained from any tusked or large-toothed mammal such as a walrus or narwhal. [Source: Getty AAT]</crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>
